                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I really can't find a single good thing in this game. \n\nFirst of all - your character is ALWAYS running, you can't just stand and time your jumps. It's such a frustrating mechanic that leads to a lot of missed jumps.\nSecond - everytime you jump, you always get that feeling that you'll not make it and eventually fall.\nThe game world is bland and uninteresting. Music - childishly generic.\n\nIf you want a good platformer with animals and especially - rabbit, better look for an old-school game called Jazz Jackrabbit.",
